            "title": "Does AMG\u2019s Alternatives-Driven Earnings Beat and Buybacks Change The Bull Case For Affiliated Managers Group (AMG)?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Affiliated Managers Group recently reported stronger than expected third-quarter 2025 results, with higher revenues, improved assets under management, and US$77,000,000 of share repurchases, while also guiding to higher adjusted EBITDA and economic net income in the fourth quarter. The quarter underscored the growing importance of private markets and liquid alternatives, which generated 55% of EBITDA, alongside US$9,000,000,000 in net client inflows and four new affiliate partnerships...",
